Subject: consultation on INLA required, on a spatially structured model with mixed effects
Message-ID: <aGN1kMRLSQQ.WZ96KV4CAQAJ@r-inla-discussion-group.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/r-inla-discussion-group/c/aGN1kMRLSQQ/m/WZ96KV4CAQAJ>
