doing

	f(v, copy="u")

will not do a scaling, which you need as binomial and Gaussian is on a
different scale, do

	f(v, copy="u", hyper = list(beta = list(prior = "normal",
						param = c(1,10),
						fixed = FALSE)))

or with some prior, but 'fixed = FALSE' is required as 'TRUE' is the
default

H

